@startuml state-outbox-event
!include ../_style/rahyaab-uml.iuml
skinparam linetype polyline
title A gameplay event in the outbox (UML state machine)
[*] --> Queued : committed to SQLite
Queued --> Held : [consent pending]
Held --> Queued : consent granted
Held --> Purged : after 14 days
Queued --> Sending : batch picked
Sending --> Acked : accepted / duplicate
Sending --> Rejected : schema or order error
Sending --> Queued : offline, 429, 5xx /\nbackoff with jitter
Acked --> Purged : after 7 days
Rejected --> Purged : after 7 days
Purged --> [*]
@enduml
